This repository is made for you can see and dowload some of the packs of WindStorm.

FOR TEXTURE PACKS YOU CAN...
You can use it freely in your Minecraft.
You can use it on servers but you need to put an extra credit.
You can share them with friends.
You CAN'T edit the textures and publish it like your work.
You CAN'T put the textures on a pay-wall.
You CAN'T steal the textures for other texture pack.

FOR ADDONS YOU CAN...
You can use it freely in your Minecraft.
You can share them with friends.
You CAN'T use it on servers.
You CAN'T edit the addon and publish it like your work.
You CAN'T put the addon on a pay-wall.
You CAN'T steal the code or textures for other addon.
